[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" load_steps=3 format=3]

; Paper, and the only pale thing in the building.
;
; Documents were the same colour as whatever they were mounted on, which made a
; card on a switchboard invisible -- and this is a game where reading the
; documents is how you get out. Everything else here is between 5% and 20%
; albedo; paper sits at 55% and is the brightest surface in Act 1 after the
; lamps. That is deliberate: it is how a player finds one across a dark room.

[ext_resource type="Shader" path="res://src/render/surface.gdshader" id="1_shader"]
